+     * ProcessInput) applies plain manipulation deltas from a mouse pointer straight to the
+     * content, with touch-style overpan (it snaps back at END); its inertia session, which
+     * clamps to the content boundary and animates through the Windows Animation Manager, only
+     * opens for touch and touchpad input events.
+     * TEMP DIAG: WINE_WHEEL_MODE=2 emits one BEGIN|INERTIA output instead, and
+     * WINE_WHEEL_INPUT_TYPE=5 reports the wheel as touchpad input (PT_TOUCHPAD), the pair that
+     * should route the wheel through DManip's inertia session. */
+    {
